{% comment %} ================================================================
Sleeper One-on-One Matchups — shared templates

All data arrives pre-resolved from serverless.js as the `sleeper` merge variable:
  sleeper.view        pre_season | matchup | status | winner | none
  sleeper.status      Sleeper league status (after test_status override)
  sleeper.week / is_playoffs / playoff_round / bracket_type
  sleeper.league      { name, avatar, season }
  sleeper.my_team     configured user's team for the title bar (or null)
  sleeper.team1/2     { team_name, username, avatar, record, wins, losses, score }
  sleeper.status_text BYE WEEK | FIRST ROUND BYE | AWAITING OPPONENT | SEASON OVER
  sleeper.winner      { team_name, username, avatar }
  sleeper.error       message if the serverless function failed
================================================================ {% endcomment %}

